        "TileImage": "$($repository efb0894c-426e-4f66-9822-880d1e735047).Image",
        "Description": "The Indie rock band &quot;The Class&quot; is currently in Bangkok recording a new Album and the Guitarist for the band Heidi Santoro has informed us that she has a stalker. According to what she has said the stalker was not that big of a problem until recently where said stalker has been sending her photos of her while she is recording with the band. She is convinced that the Stalker is dangerous and is also at the hotel where she is staying at.\r\rShe want him gone Silently as the Band is unaware of him.",
